## Default behavior

- Treat requests as bug fixes, small polish, or answers — not open-ended improvement passes.
- Keep diffs minimal. Do not expand scope.
- Do not commit unless asked.
- Do not run `dotnet format` with collection-expression rules enabled; they have broken `new(comparer)` initializers before.

Prioritize user-reported issues over speculative improvements. Re-verify with:

- `dotnet build RelicTracker/RelicTracker.csproj -c Release -p:Platform=x64`
- `py data/validate_data.py`
